Acknowledgement
---------------

ShadowsocksX-NG helped inspire the original idea for a convenient desktop
Shadowsocks controller. LibreWing has its own Linux implementation, product
structure, wording, and visual assets. This project is not endorsed by or
affiliated with the upstream Shadowsocks project.

Google Material Symbols
-----------------------

The LibreWing application and status icons incorporate a modified version of
Google Material Symbols' "route" icon, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons

simple-obfs
-----------

Release packages may contain the obfs-local executable from simple-obfs:
https://github.com/shadowsocks/simple-obfs

The Debian build copies the accompanying copyright metadata into
/usr/share/doc/librewing/simple-obfs-copyright. The exact source
package version and SHA-256 values are pinned in scripts/build-deb.sh.
